### Authentication Flow Test Suite
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@timestamp = {{$datetime 'YYYYMMDDHHmmss'}}
@testUsername = testuser_{{timestamp}}
@testPassword = TestPass123
@testEmail = test+{{timestamp}}@fosforescent.com

### Variables (will be set during flow)
# @authToken = 
# @userId = 

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Check if username is available
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/check-username
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{testUsername}}"
}

###

### 3. Register new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{testUsername}}",
  "password": "{{testPassword}}",
  "accepted_terms": true,
  "cookies": {}
}

###

### 4. Login with new user credentials
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{testUsername}}",
  "password": "{{testPassword}}"
}

###

### 5. Verify JWT token (replace {{authToken}} with token from login response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-jwt
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Get user profile (protected endpoint)
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Get user data (protected endpoint)
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/data
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. Test invalid login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{testUsername}}",
  "password": "WrongPassword123"
}

###

### 9. Test missing credentials
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "password": ""
}

###

### 10. Test weak password registration
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{testUsername}}_weak",
  "password": "weak",
  "accepted_terms": true,
  "cookies": {}
}

###

### 11. Test duplicate username registration
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{testUsername}}",
  "password": "{{testPassword}}",
  "accepted_terms": true,
  "cookies": {}
}

###

### 12. Test registration without accepting terms
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{testUsername}}_terms",
  "password": "{{testPassword}}",
  "accepted_terms": false,
  "cookies": {}
}

###

### 13. Test protected endpoint without token
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/profile
Accept: application/json

###

### 14. Test protected endpoint with invalid token
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer invalid.jwt.token
Accept: application/json

###